  "anthropology":{collocations:["cultural anthropology","physical anthropology","social anthropology","evolutionary anthropology","visual anthropology","biological anthropology"],examples:[{en:"\"In anthropology, you can't equate third gender with homosexuality,\" he said.",zh:"“在人类学中，你不能将同性恋和第三性别混同，”他说。"},{en:"When I was a student at Cambridge I remember an anthropology professor holding up a picture of a bone with 28 incisions carved in it.",zh:"当我还在剑桥读书的时候，我记得有一位人类学的教授拿出一张照片，上面是一根有28个切口的骨头。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "antibiotic":{collocations:["antibiotic resistance","broad spectrum antibiotic"],examples:[{en:"Thatreally sped up the development of penicillin as an antibiotic.",zh:"这确实加快了青霉素作为抗生素的发展。"},{en:"The efficiency of testing at the tanker level is why regulations require such testing for antibiotic residues.",zh:"在罐水平检测的效率是为什么条例要求这类抗生素残留检测的原因。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "antibiotics":{collocations:["aminoglycoside antibiotics"],examples:[{en:"Your doctor may prescribe antibiotics.",zh:"你的大夫可能会开抗生素。"}],deepExplanation:""},
