  "antidote":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"When he returned, he noticed their sickness and prepared an antidote.",zh:"当他返回时，他注意到了他们的病情，准备了解毒药。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "antifebrile":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"Objective To explore the antifebrile effects and changes of toxicity after compatibility of both compound isatis leaf injection and compound amidopyrine injection.",zh:"目的探索复方大青叶注射液与复方氨基比林注射液配伍后的解热效果及毒性的变化。"},{en:"Conclusion: The abuse of antibiotic, hormone, antifebrile is common in the outpatients, and the use of drug in the outpatients should be more properly adminstrated.",zh:"结论院外抗生素、激素、退热药的使用存在滥用现象，需要进一步规范儿童呼吸道感染的临床用药。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "antifreeze":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"The frogs' resilience is linked to a shifting of water to areas less likely to be damaged by freezing, as well as natural \"antifreeze\" in their blood.",zh:"这种蛙类的回复机制是这样的：通过把水分转移到一些不会被冰冻伤害的部位，以达到一种“血液防冻剂”的目的。"},{en:"The chemical, ethylene glycol, is widely used in products from polyester fibres to antifreeze for cars.",zh:"乙二醇目前广泛应用于各种产品中，包括聚酯纤维和汽车防冻剂。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "antigen":{collocations:["surface antigen","carcinoembryonic antigen","coating antigen"],examples:[{en:"Lassa fever is diagnosed by detection of Lassa antigen, anti-Lassa antibodies, or virus isolation techniques.",zh:"拉沙热通过发现拉沙抗原、抗拉沙抗体或病毒分离技术进行诊断。"},{en:"Scientists have recently discovered they can reduce the amount of antigen used to produce pandemic influenza vaccines by using water-in-oil substances that enhance the immune response.",zh:"科学家最近发现，如果使用油包水型物质来强化免疫反应，生产大流行性流感疫苗所使用的抗原量就可以减少。"}],deepExplanation:""},
