  "antitoxin":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"In Thailand, delivery of a botulism antitoxin prevented multiple deaths.",zh:"在泰国，肉毒抗毒素避免了多起死亡的发生。"},{en:"Although antitoxin for the treatment of botulism is only available in some countries, WHO was able to ensure delivery of antitoxin to Thailand by the morning of 19 March.",zh:"虽然只在某些国家可获得治疗肉毒中毒的抗毒素，但是世卫组织能确保到3月19日上午向泰国提供抗毒素。"}],deepExplanation:""},
