  "antler":{collocations:["pilose antler","deer antler"],examples:[{en:"Each has a snug mezzanine area and an antler-fenced balcony about eight metres above ground.",zh:"两间树屋离开地面有八米之高，每间屋里有舒适的房间和由鹿角做围篱的阳台。"},{en:"At first the scientists believed the geometrical figure carved onto the antler could have been either the mentioned woman, or a nude man raising his arms.",zh:"一开始，科学家们认为刻画在鹿角上的几何图案有可能是之前说到的女性，也可能是一个举着双臂的裸体男性。"}],deepExplanation:""},
