  "anxiety":{collocations:["anxiety disorder","anxiety for sth","test anxiety","trait anxiety","anxiety neurosis","generalized anxiety disorder","performance anxiety"],examples:[{en:"his feelings of anxiety",zh:"他焦虑的心情"},{en:"A high level of anxiety was created by the introduction of cameras into the factory.",zh:"工厂安装了摄像头，这引起了工人的高度不安。"}],deepExplanation:""},
