  "aorta":{collocations:["abdominal aorta","thoracic aorta","ascending aorta","descending aorta"],examples:[{en:"And because it is from a reconstituted aorta, the doctors do not need to administer anti-rejection drugs, which react to cancer treatments.",zh:"由于人工气管是由再造主动脉制成，医生不需要是用抗排斥药物来应对癌症治疗过程中的反应。"},{en:"AAA is a localized widening and weakening of the abdominal aorta, and primarily affects elderly Caucasian men who smoke, have high blood pressure and high cholesterol levels.",zh:"AAA可引起腹主动脉的局部扩张和弱化，其主要影响人群为吸烟的，有高血压和高胆固醇水平的老年高加索人。"}],deepExplanation:""},
