  "aperiodic":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"Most of the sequences are aperiodic with recurrence intervals varying from a few minutes to hundreds of days.",zh:"大部分相似地震的活动表现为非周期性，重复间隔从数分钟到数百天不等。"},{en:"And it is further proved that the technique is effective and practical by means of the examples of the extraction of periodic and aperiodic signals.",zh:"运用周期和非周期弱信号的检测实例，进一步证明了该方法的有效性和实用性。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "aperitif":{collocations:["aperitif wine"],examples:[{en:"The rise of white wine as an aperitif can be traced to this date, and the co-operative of Plaimont – producers of this wine – were pioneers in the field.",zh:"始自这一时期，白葡萄酒渐渐被作为开胃酒，而制造它们的普莱蒙合作公司就是这一领域的先驱。"},{en:"Another wine will come after the aperitif, the sherry withthe soup course, the white wine with the lobster, the red with the roast,another red wine with the greasy ordeal of the squab.",zh:"开胃酒之后还会上酒，雪利酒是配汤的，白酒是用来配龙虾的，红酒是用来配烤肉的，还有一轮红酒是用来配那些油腻的乳鸽的。"}],deepExplanation:""},
