  "aphasia":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"There are disorders of language like aphasia.",zh:"还有很多的语言障碍,诸如失语症"},{en:"But because of the nonlinear nature of a network, when it does fail we can expect glitches like an aphasia that remembers all foods except vegetables.",zh:"但是，因为网络的非线性特质，当它确实失灵的时候，其故障可能类似于除了蔬菜什么食物都记得的失语症。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "aphorism":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"It's one thing to forget the past, with predictable consequences, as the favorite aphorism goes. But what about those who refuse to comprehend the present?",zh:"正如格言所说，展望未来，忘记过去。话是这样说，但是那些拒绝理解现在的人怎么办呢？"},{en:"That's more than a folksy aphorism when it comes to infectious diseases.",zh:"对于传染疾病而言，这句格言可就不仅仅是一句民间习语了。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "apiary":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"We went to an apiary and got real sheets of used bees wax.",zh:"我们去了一个养蜂场，得到真正的张用于蜜蜂蜡。"},{en:"The removals of the supers and the honey extraction operations are recorded in the apiary register.",zh:"蜂蜜的收获等生产活动都记录在养蜂场登记簿中。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "apiculture":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"In Asia, apiculture is an important activity in Burma, Bangladesh and India.",zh:"在亚洲缅甸、孟加拉国和印度，养蜂业是一项重要的生产。"},{en:"Francis Ratnieks, the UK's only professor of apiculture, is undertaking pioneering research using observation hives and video cameras to determine the plants and flowers that honeybees visit.",zh:"英国唯一的一位养���业教授弗朗西斯 瑞耐克斯正从事着通过对蜂窝的视频摄影机的观察来确定蜜蜂拜访的植物与花朵的一项先驱研究。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "apiece":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"The pictures are worth about £10,000 apiece.",zh:"这些画每幅价值约一万英镑。"},{en:"The two top teams have ten points apiece.",zh:"排名最高的两支球队各得十分。"}],deepExplanation:""},
