  "archaeologist":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"In fact, she was an archaeologist.",zh:"其实她是一个考古学家。"},{en:"But I do not believe, as a field archaeologist, that we can use the scientific method to prove or disprove [them].",zh:"但作为一个在现场工作的考古学家，我不相信我们能用科学手段对它们进行证实或证伪”。"}],deepExplanation:""},
