  "epidemic":{collocations:["epidemic situation","epidemic prevention","epidemic disease","epidemic encephalitis b","epidemic hemorrhagic fever","epidemic cerebrospinal meningitis","cholera epidemic"],examples:[{en:"Over 500 people died during last year’s flu epidemic.",zh:"去年流感大暴发期间有五百多人死亡。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "epidermis":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"The pigment in the upper layer of skin (epidermis) that gives your skin its normal color is called melanin.",zh:"在浅层皮肤（表皮）中有种色素能让你的皮肤保持其正常的颜色，称为黑色素。"},{en:"Skin color is due to melanin, a pigment produced in the epidermis to protect us from the sun's potentially cancer-causing ultraviolet (UV) rays.",zh:"这是一种产生于表皮的色素，能够保护我们免受来自紫外线的侵袭。 紫外线正是来自太阳的潜在致癌物。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "epigone":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"We think, IT tycoon must hour is vigilant all sorts of competitors and epigone , avoid in-house error at the same time.",zh:"我们认为，IT巨头必须时刻警惕各种竞争对手和追随者，同时避免内部失误。"},{en:"You are vogue and beautiful epigone, yearn for the perfect outline of cap-a-pie , blossom a glorious of unapproachable evil spirit be puzzled.",zh:"你是时尚和漂亮的追随者，渴望从头到脚的完美轮廓，绽放出无与伦比的魅惑光彩。"}],deepExplanation:""},
