  "epithet":{collocations:["transferred epithet"],examples:[{en:"But it is impossible to predict the reaction of a man accosted by another with the words \"you rat\" without referring to the meaning that the man spoken to attaches to the epithet.",zh:"但是，当你不带意识地，说出别人的绰号“老鼠”的时候，你还是无法预测这个人会有怎样的反应。"},{en:"My teen years were marked by the common epithet “Camel Jockey” and the hit AM radio song “Ahab the A-rab.”",zh:"“骆驼骑师” （Camel Jockey）和调幅电台的热门歌曲“Ahab the A-rab”是我青少年时代人们通用的绰号。"}],deepExplanation:""},
