  "epitomise":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"Avarice, embarrassment, boredom, depression, jealousy and love, for example, might epitomise the modern age.",zh:"比如说，有可能象征现代的贪婪，尴尬，乏味，沮丧，嫉妒和爱等。"},{en:"She was 16 when she started modelling in 1966 and by the late 80s the slender adolescent body had come to epitomise female beauty.",zh:"她在1966年16岁时开始了模特生涯。 至80年代后期，青春期男孩般纤细的身材成为女性美的象征。"}],deepExplanation:""},
