  "eugenic":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"The author thinks that chromosomal abnormality is of importance to causing spontaneous abortion and puts foward a series of proposals on eugenic.",zh:"结合文献，对自然流产与染色体异常的发生率、病因等加以探讨，并提出一系列优生��议。"},{en:"Here the message of past eugenic practices is clear. Never let a government, no matter how apparently benign, into the process.",zh:"反思过去实施过的优生政策的教训是很清楚的：绝不能让政府介人此事，不管它是个多么善良、慈爱的政府。"}],deepExplanation:""},
