  "frugality":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"If your goal is frugality, then consider what things are not necessary, the long-term impact of the choice you make and whether you can afford it.",zh:"如果你的目标是俭省，那么就考虑什么东西是没必要的，你做出选择后的长期影响以及你是否可以担负得起。"},{en:"I’m doing so to show you that if there’s not a little frugality in you already, there easily could be. Why?",zh:"我这么做只是为了告诉你们如果到这一刻为止你还未曾尝试过节俭一点的话，那么你是很容易做到的，为什么？"}],deepExplanation:""},
