  "fruition":{collocations:["come to fruition"],examples:[{en:"After months of hard work, our plans finally came to fruition .",zh:"经过几个月的艰苦工作，我们的计划终于完成了。"},{en:"The essentials of the reward system in science are \"peer recognition\" of scientists fruition of originality.",zh:"科学奖励的实质是对科学家独创性成就的“同行承认”。"}],deepExplanation:""},
