  "fungi":{collocations:["edible fungi","imperfect fungi","filamentous fungi"],examples:[{en:"Without the fungi, this would be just another sandbar.",zh:"如果没有真菌，这里将成为另一个沙洲。"},{en:"But without fungi we would not have gardens, houses or even feet at all.",zh:"但是，如果没有真菌，我们就不会有花园、住宅，甚至脚。"}],deepExplanation:""},
