  "hepatic":{collocations:["hepatic artery","hepatic carcinoma","hepatic cirrhosis","hepatic failure","hepatic encephalopathy","hepatic vein","hepatic disease","hepatic duct"],examples:[{en:"Lead can cause a wide range of disorders, including anaemia and hepatic and neurological disorders and food can be a major route of exposure.",zh:"铅可引起一系列广泛的疾病，包括贫血和肝病以及神经紊乱，而食品可能是一个重要的接触途径。"},{en:"Acute liver failure can cause many complications, including excessive bleeding and increasing pressure in the brain. Another term for acute liver failure is fulminant hepatic failure.",zh:"急性肝衰竭能导致许多并发症，包括大出血和颅内压增高。急性肝衰竭的另一种类型是暴发性肝衰竭。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "hepatitis":{collocations:["hepatitis b","hepatitis c","hepatitis b virus","viral hepatitis","hepatitis a","hepatitis virus","virus hepatitis","hepatitis b vaccine"],examples:[{en:"What is hepatitis?",zh:"什么是肝炎？"},{en:"WHO will work in close collaboration with all our partners to prevent and control viral hepatitis.",zh:"世卫组织将与所有合作伙伴紧密合作，预防和控制病毒性肝炎。"}],deepExplanation:""},
