  "herbaceous":{collocations:["herbaceous plant"],examples:[{en:"The Siberian genseng plant is a shrub of 1 to 3 meters tall, while the ginseng plant is herbaceous.",zh:"西伯利亚人参植物是一个1到3米多高的灌木，而人参的植物是草本植物。"},{en:"Configuration feature: Aquatic or wet unripe herbaceous, or bacterium root nutrition and without chlorophyll.",zh:"形态特征： 水生或湿生草本，或菌根营养而无叶绿素。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "herbicide":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"But water containing the herbicide cannot be released back into the river and it is known that low water levels can harm river ecosystems accustomed to higher levels.",zh:"但含有除草剂的水不能再排向河流，而且我们知道低水位将会对习惯于高水位的河流生态系统造成危害。"},{en:"Genetically altered soybeans and cotton require less herbicide to control weeds. These varieties now make up more than 70 percent of all soybean and cotton acreage planted in the United States.",zh:"转基因的大豆和棉花不需要那么多除草剂来控制杂草，这些品种现在占美国大豆和棉花种植面积的70%以上。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "herbivore":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"Most herbivore teeth are grinders, canines are usually absent.",zh:"食草动物的牙齿大部分是臼齿，通常没有犬齿。"},{en:"Some examples of heavy herbivore pressure may help appreciation of the possible brevity of the selection process .",zh:"植食动物强大压力的一些事例可以帮助我们对选择过程的简略性有所了解。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "herbivorous":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"\" Cornett's attorney, Jack Johnston, said the tooth \"looks like it would be from a herbivorous rodent of some type.",zh:"科内特的律师杰克·约翰斯顿说，这颗牙“看起来像是某种食草的啮齿类动物的牙。”"},{en:"'Chewing is a property which no large herbivorous terrestrial mammal has got rid of, ' said Professor Martin Sander, from Bonn University.",zh:"“现在，没有大型陆生食草哺乳动物是不需要咀嚼的，”波恩大学的马丁·桑德教授说。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "herd":{collocations:["a herd of","herd behavior","herd instinct"],examples:[{en:"You have to be an individual; it’s no use running with the herd.",zh:"你必须特立独行，随大溜没有用处。"}],deepExplanation:""},
