  "hexagonal":{collocations:["hexagonal system","hexagonal nut"],examples:[{en:"Instead it is the Desert Express that pulls in, its nine coaches in smart blue, orange and white livery with large hexagonal windows.",zh:"然而驶进车站的是沙漠快车，它的九节车厢漆成漂亮的蓝色、橙色和白色，带有六边形的车窗。"},{en:"He has instead looked to the hexagonal matrices of snowflakes, which as structurally supported objects combine high volume with low weight.",zh:"他期望使用雪花的六角形矩阵造型来作为支撑，因为这种结构做到了低重量与大容量的统一。"}],deepExplanation:""},
