  "hibiscus":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"Our Galapagos tortoise are responsive to bright coloured, edible flowers and fruit, such as roses, hibiscus, grapes and watermelon.",zh:"加拉巴哥象龟对于颜色鲜艳的可食花草和水果情有独钟，例如玫瑰花，芙蓉，葡萄，西瓜等。"},{en:"Taurus mom's soft and sentimental nature can be bowled over by gifting her with a bouquet of tropical hibiscus- she will just love them. Their soft, billowy petals appeal to her tangible nature.",zh:"金牛妈妈温柔恬静、多愁善感；一捧热带的芙蓉花一定会让她开心不已，要是再配上色彩明亮的包装纸，那就更好了。"}],deepExplanation:""},
