  "hierarchy":{collocations:["social hierarchy","hierarchy system","inheritance hierarchy","hierarchy of needs","knowledge hierarchy","hierarchy of needs theory","object hierarchy","feudal hierarchy"],examples:[{en:"We need two new Classes at either end of the inheritance hierarchy to do this.",zh:"在继承层次的每个端点，我们需要两个新类来完成这个。"},{en:"Thus you have only one hierarchy of loggers for all users. You lose isolation.",zh:"这样，所有的用户只有一个层次结构，您会失去隔离性。"}],deepExplanation:""},
