  "hydrolysis":{collocations:["enzymatic hydrolysis","acid hydrolysis","alkaline hydrolysis","degree of hydrolysis"],examples:[{en:"When water reacts with the fats and oils, a reaction called hydrolysis, the result is glycerol and soap.",zh:"当水与脂肪和油产生一种被称为水解的化学反应时，其产物是甘油与肥皂。"},{en:"The possible hydrolysis of sucrose to reducing sugars during processing also is to be considered .",zh:"当然也要考虑加工过程中蔗糖有可能水解变成还原糖。"}],deepExplanation:""},
