  "hyena":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"\"Maybe a hyena chewed off the face soon after it died, \" White said.",zh:"“也许在它死后不久，土狼就咬掉了它的面部，”怀特说。"},{en:"He couldn’t see the hyena, but the stench of it was there, the stagnant reek of meat and sweat and piss.",zh:"他看不见鬣狗，但是他能嗅到它身上的恶臭，那混杂着肉味、汗味和尿骚的恶臭。"}],deepExplanation:""},
