  "hypercritical":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"He's as big a geek as Zuckerberg, but of a different type: the hypercritical, even sometimes nasty type.",zh:"他与扎克伯格一样，是个超级极客，只不过是另一种类型的：他吹毛求疵，有时甚至令人讨厌。"},{en:"I know it's time to grow up, stop being hypercritical and just enter the dating pool, with all its clichés and absolute disappointments.",zh:"我知道，是时候要长大了，我该停止吹毛求疵，去约会，不管它有多老套，有多让人失望。"}],deepExplanation:""},
