  "hypnotism":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"Dulcy also saw a psychiatrist who used hypnotism to help her deal with her fear.",zh:"达尔茜还去看了精神科医生，那医生使用催眠术帮她消除恐惧感。"}],deepExplanation:""},
