  "introspect":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"The point is, if you just can't get things done, and this has been going on for a long time, then it's time to self-introspect and find out what this is all about.",zh:"重点是，如果你连完成工作都不能做到，而且这已经花费了很长一段时间，那么是时候该进行自身的反省并找出关于这个的全部原因。"},{en:"However, this is wrong, since through the reflection API, you are able to introspect a class to discover the types of its fields or of its methods arguments with the generics details.",zh:"然而，这是错误的看法，通过反射API，你可以内省一个类从而发现它的成员变量类型或者它的有泛型详细信息的方法参数类型。"}],deepExplanation:""},
