  "isothermal":{collocations:["isothermal forging","isothermal quenching","isothermal compression","isothermal condition","isothermal adsorption","isothermal transformation","isothermal annealing","isothermal process"],examples:[{en:"And you know, you could have a reversible engine with lots and lots of steps, but you could always break them down into some sequence of adiabatic and isothermal steps.",zh:"你们知道，我们可以设计一个由，很多很多个,循环步骤的热机，但是总可以把它分割成,一系列的绝热,和等温过程。"},{en:"As long as it's reversible, you know what the efficiency has to be, and in principle, you could break it down into a bunch of steps that you could formulate as isothermal and adiabatic.",zh:"只要这个循环过程是可逆的，你们知道效率是多少，从理论上说，可以将总过程,分解成一系列绝热,和等温的小过程。"}],deepExplanation:""},
