  "morphogenetic":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"There, scientists have been manipulating the levels of bone-morphogenetic protein or BMP in the brains of laboratory mice.",zh:"在那里，科学家已经成功操纵了小白鼠大脑中的骨形态发生蛋白（或称BMP）的水平。"},{en:"AIM: To explore the expression of bone morphogenetic protein (BMP) in transplantation healing with massive bone allograft and the significance by animal experiment.",zh:"目的：通过动物实验来探讨骨形态发生蛋白在大段同种异体骨移植愈合中的表达及其意义。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "morphology":{collocations:["surface morphology","crystal morphology","plant morphology"],examples:[{en:"The rash morphology progresses from papules to pustules and finally to crusting lesions.",zh:"皮疹的形态从最初的丘疹发展至脓疱，最终局部脱屑。"},{en:"In fact, a major theme in research here is how the morphology of the bird influences its behavior.",zh:"实际上，探寻鸟类形态如何影响它的行为是该实验室的主要研究课题。"}],deepExplanation:""},
