  "mortar":{collocations:["cement mortar","dry mortar","polymer mortar","lime mortar","brick and mortar","resin mortar"],examples:[{en:"So they had bricks for stone and asphalt for mortar.",zh:"于是他们用砖代替石头，沥青代替灰泥。"},{en:"Even the flimsiest of science fiction or the nastiest of horror stories or the most intricate of spy novels uses this as the mortar to bond together its narrative.",zh:"即便是最天花乱坠的科幻小说、最荒唐无稽的恐怖小说和最错综复杂的间谍小说也都用这些元素作为粘合叙述的灰泥。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "mortgage":{collocations:["housing mortgage","mortgage loan","subprime mortgage","mortgage market","home mortgage","housing mortgage loan","subprime mortgage crisis","mortgage lending"],examples:[{en:"The bank refused to accept any mortgage on land.",zh:"银行拒绝接受任何土地抵押。"},{en:"At this point, such claims have no bearing on the mortgage or housing crisis; they have bearing only on the holders of these securities themselves.",zh:"从这一点上来说，这些贷款凭证与抵押贷款或住房危机没有任何关系，他们只与拥有这些证券的持有者有关。"}],deepExplanation:""},
