  "mortuary":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"If you try any monkey tricks with me, I will shoot you right away, and your family can come and collect your body in the mortuary.",zh:"如果你们谁敢跟我耍花样，我现在就枪毙了他，他的家人可以等着到太平间里认领他的尸体。"},{en:"Her eyes were shut. If it was not for the fact you could see her breathing — and the odd flutter of her eyelid — she could indeed have been a body in a ­mortuary.",zh:"她的眼睛是闭着的（译注：可能这位记者的眼睛才是闭着的），如果你没有注意到她的呼吸和她眼睑的振颤，她简直就像一具放在太平间里的死尸。"}],deepExplanation:""},
