  "tyrosine":{collocations:["tyrosine hydroxylase"],examples:[{en:"The pleasure-inducing chemical dopamine contains tyrosine and phenylalanine, a pair of amino acids that can be found in protein-packed foods like fish, meat and beans.",zh:"快乐诱导化学多巴胺包含包含酪氨酸和苯丙氨酸，两种可以于富含蛋白质的食品如鱼，肉，豆类等食品中找到的氨基酸。"},{en:"Yogurt also supplies the brain with tyrosine, an amino acid that boosts blood levels of the neurotransmitters dopamine and norepinephrine, resulting in a mood and mental boost.",zh:"酸奶还能向大脑供给酪氨酸，这种氨基酸能提升血液中的神经介质多巴胺和去甲肾上腺素水平，从而提升人的情绪和心情。"}],deepExplanation:""},
